From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 00:17:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] drm/asahi: G16: keep eight render commands resident
 by default

Raise the default g16_resident from 4 to 8: six compact render units
next to the two full-size ones.

Measured on the J604 (split boot, session unlocked, display on),
gpubench render.light (tri) at queue depth 64, median us per submit:
depth 4 192.5, depth 8 176.1 (-28 % against the 244.4 of the older
defaults). deqp-vk ov3-render ran before each depth with 0 failures.

Each compact unit backs about 51 MiB per rendering client, about
300 MiB for the six. With units now rotated, closed clients' arenas are
released once live clients render again. g16_resident=4 restores the
previous default.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/params.rs | 6 +++---
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/params.rs b/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/params.rs
index 69453e2271..a5f33c745a 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/params.rs
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/asahi/g16/params.rs
@@ -920,8 +920,8 @@ pub(crate) fn flights() -> usize {
     "G16: render commands in flight at once, 1 (default, the qualified one-at-a-time protocol) or 2 (one render published behind a running render; experimental; runtime 0644)"
 );
 
-/// Storage of `g16_resident` (runtime 0644, default 4).
-static RESIDENT: AtomicU32 = AtomicU32::new(4);
+/// Storage of `g16_resident` (runtime 0644, default 8).
+static RESIDENT: AtomicU32 = AtomicU32::new(8);
 
 /// Render pass units per VM, latched at the first G16 slot setup of the boot: 0 until then.
 static RESIDENT_LATCH: AtomicU32 = AtomicU32::new(0);
@@ -1000,7 +1000,7 @@ pub(crate) fn resident_credits() -> u32 {
     RESIDENT_PARM,
     RESIDENT,
     "g16_resident",
-    "G16: render commands that may be resident in the firmware rings at once, each in its own render unit (default 4; 0 or 1: off; 2..4, 2..18 with g16_resident_compact=1; >= 3 must be set at module load to allocate the extra units; needs g16_overlap=1 and g16_uma_split=1; runtime 0644)"
+    "G16: render commands that may be resident in the firmware rings at once, each in its own render unit (default 8; 0 or 1: off; 2..4, 2..18 with g16_resident_compact=1; >= 3 must be set at module load to allocate the extra units; needs g16_overlap=1 and g16_uma_split=1; runtime 0644)"
 );
 
 /// Storage of `g16_submit_ahead` (runtime 0644, default 0).
-- 
